# Context rules for hack/dev.Dockerfile only. BuildKit prefers a
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore over a root one, so keeping these rules here means
# they cannot reach the release images, whose contexts goreleaser assembles
# itself and which must keep copying exactly what they copy today.
#
# .git is excluded because it changes on every commit and would invalidate every
# stage that copies the tree. The release-config check synthesizes a repository
# instead. The unit tests need it, so they bind-mount the tree rather than
# running as a stage.
.git
dist
_work
.idea
.vscode
.claude
.DS_Store
*.patch
*.diff
